{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>去山區行山一定要準備捱苦嗎？意大利多洛米蒂絕對會顛覆你的想像！這裡擁有完善的纜車系統，一轉眼就能把你送到二千米高的高原步道。無論你是行山新手還是老手，都能在這裡找到適合自己的路線，一邊漫步一邊將絕美的自然美景盡收眼底。\n</p>\n<p>最令人驚喜的是山頂的補給站，這裡的山屋簡直就像高級餐廳。行山後可以吃著美味的餐點，喝著美酒，躺在草地上曬太陽，將戶外運動與極致享受完美結合。</p>\n<p>留言「PM」，即刻 send 完整多洛米蒂景點及行程詳細資料比你！</p>\n<p>好動旅人 ｜ 旅遊不止食買玩，用跑步、潛水或滑雪等活動探索世界，在運動的節奏裡，發現每個地方最真實的風景。邊一場戶外旅程令你最難忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的冒險故事！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301604251158757_7677029326adf40eb39e7f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179301604251158757_7677029326adf40eb39e7f.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@rodmanwalkwhat)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/De9Br1aTGpb/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%a4%9a%e6%b4%9b%e7%b1%b3%e8%92%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">多洛米蒂</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%84%8f%e5%a4%a7%e5%88%a9%e6%97%85%e8%a1%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">意大利旅行</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@rodmanwalkwhat資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/De9Br1aTGpb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nOct 26 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T12:20:58.075296+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":455,"images":1,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:00:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T12:18:27.945459+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T12:18:27.945459+00:00","content_hash":"b82b00175c22b7133e5d5920fa14f03d11595ef9b7eee7670c712550ce62b4d0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}